  {
    "name": "stripe_payment_session",
    "desc": "Stripe 支付会话：Elements 脚本 + 支付 API + Checkout 页 + 风控信标。支付强依赖同出口 IP，跨出口易触发 3DS/拒付",
    "requests": [
      {
        "host": "js.stripe.com"
      },
      {
        "host": "api.stripe.com"
      },
      {
        "host": "checkout.stripe.com"
      },
      {
        "host": "q.stripe.com",
        "note": "遥测/风控信标"
      },
      {
        "host": "m.stripe.network",
        "note": "设备指纹/风控"
      }
    ],
    "assert": {
      "same_policy": true,
      "policy": "Payment",
      "no_dns_leak": true
    },
    "note": "2026-08-25 F1：stripe.com 自 AI.list 移入 ProxyGFW.list，并补 stripe.network。2026-08-29：新建 Payment.list（国际支付渠道专表），stripe.com/stripe.network 自 ProxyGFW.list 移入，stripecdn.com/stripeassets.com 自 DownloadCDN.list 移入；期望落点由兜底组 Final 改为专用策略组 Payment（固定家宽出口，保证 Elements/API/Checkout/风控信标同 IP）。本断言需 Surge.conf 增加 RULE-SET,…/Payment.list,Payment 后方能通过——conf 由主控统一落地。"
  },
